  "text": "Library Collections Sokoine National Agricultural Library (SNAL) Sokoine University of Agriculture Have any questions? +255 23 260 4639 snal@sua.ac.tz Sidebar × Main Menu Home About About SNAL Our Library SNAL Leadership Our Team Former Library staff Administrative staff Library Collections General Collections Special Collection e-Resources & Periodicals Special Reserve Join the Library FAQ Contact Us SNAL Former Leaders Sections ICT section Archive, Bibliographic and Documentation section The Reference and Community Information Services section Knowledge Management section E-Resources section Solomon Mahlangu Campus Library section Mizengo Pinda Campus College Library section Services Mkulima Repositories E-Books & Journals Catalogue Blog SUA Home About About SNAL Our Library SNAL Leadership Our Team Former Library staff Administrative staff Library Collections General Collections Special Collection e-Resources & Periodicals Special Reserve Join the Library FAQ Contact Us SNAL Former Leaders Sections ICT section Archive, Bibliographic and Documentation section The Reference and Community Information Services section Knowledge Management section E-Resources section Solomon Mahlangu Campus Library section Mizengo Pinda Campus College Library section Services Mkulima Repositories E-Books & Journals Catalogue Blog SUA Library Collections The Library Contains over 90,000 volumes of books on Various aspects of Agricultural Sciences and other related fields including veterinary medicine, Agribusiness, Humanities,Environmental,Forestry and Allied Sciences. General Collection General Collection Contains thousands of books in various discplines offered at SUA including Agriculture, Environmental Science, Food Science, Forestry, Natural Resources, Nutrition, Rural Development, Veterinary Science Read more Special Collection This Section Consists of books published in Tanzania that are mainly acquired through legal deposits as well as books with covered in Kenya and Uganda . Other Material includes the following Read More e-Resources & Periodicals This collection subscribes to thousands of electronic journals and books databases which can be accessed through LibHub also the collection has various electronic materials in CD-ROM for various Read more Special Reserve Special Reserve Contains books reserved by lectures that are considered to be in great demand by students in various disciplines offered at SUA . Books are borrowed on hourly basis Read More Address Sokoine National Agricultural Library (SNAL) Sokoine University of Agriculture P.O Box 3022 Chuo Kikuu Morogoro Phone:  +255 23 260 4639 Email: snal@sua.ac.tz QUICK LINKS Library catalogue TaCCIRe SUAIR LibHub MyLoft TEEAL Main Campus TEEAL SMC Ask a Librarian Copyright © 2018 Sokoine National Agricultural Library. All Rights Reserved.",
